Description: safely manage local and remote Ollama and OpenCode settings
 LLM-Manager diagnoses Linux hosts and applies explicitly approved settings
 through a narrowly scoped privileged helper. It provides a PySide6 desktop
 interface while keeping all privileged work outside the GUI process.
